#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MULTICHANNELCRITTERSENSOR.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MULTICHANNELCRITTERSENSOR.DESC"
msgid "Tracking exactly which critters and eggs share a room allows for much finer control over automated ranching."
msgstr "精确掌握房间内有哪些小动物和蛋，可以更精细地控制自动化畜牧。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MULTICHANNELCRITTERSENSOR.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MULTICHANNELCRITTERSENSOR.EFFECT"
msgid "Counts the selected <link=\"CREATURES\">Critters</link> and Eggs in its room and writes the results to an <link=\"LOGICRIBBON\">Automation Ribbon</link>:\n\n<b>Bit 1</b>: <b><style=\"logic_on\">Green Signal</style></b> when the count passes the threshold\n<b>Bit 2</b>: <b><style=\"logic_on\">Green Signal</style></b> when the egg count passes its own threshold (separate-thresholds mode only)\n<b>Bit 3</b>: a brief <b><style=\"logic_on\">Green Signal</style></b> pulse each time the tracked count rises\n<b>Bit 4</b>: a brief <b><style=\"logic_on\">Green Signal</style></b> pulse each time the tracked count falls\n\n<link=\"LOGICRIBBON\">Automation Ribbon</link> must be used as the output wire to avoid overloading."
msgstr "计算其所在房间内选定的<link=\"CREATURES\">小动物</link>和蛋的数量，并将结果写入<link=\"LOGICRIBBON\">信号线组</link>：\n\n<b>位1</b>：数量越过阈值时输出<b><style=\"logic_on\">绿色信号</style></b>\n<b>位2</b>：蛋数量越过其独立阈值时输出<b><style=\"logic_on\">绿色信号</style></b>（仅限独立阈值模式）\n<b>位3</b>：每当所追踪的数量上升时输出一次短暂的<b><style=\"logic_on\">绿色信号</style></b>脉冲\n<b>位4</b>：每当所追踪的数量下降时输出一次短暂的<b><style=\"logic_on\">绿色信号</style></b>脉冲\n\n输出必须用<link=\"LOGICRIBBON\">信号线组</link>以免过载。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MULTICHANNELCRITTERSENSOR.LOGIC_PORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MULTICHANNELCRITTERSENSOR.LOGIC_PORT"
msgid "Critter Count (4-Bit)"
msgstr "小动物数量（四位）"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MULTICHANNELCRITTERSENSOR.LOGIC_PORT_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MULTICHANNELCRITTERSENSOR.LOGIC_PORT_ACTIVE"
msgid "Bit 1: <b><style=\"logic_on\">Green Signal</style></b> if the tracked count is past the threshold\nBit 2: <b><style=\"logic_on\">Green Signal</style></b> if the egg count is past its threshold (separate mode)\nBit 3: <b><style=\"logic_on\">Green Signal</style></b> pulse when the tracked count rises\nBit 4: <b><style=\"logic_on\">Green Signal</style></b> pulse when the tracked count falls"
msgstr "位1：所追踪的数量越过阈值时输出<b><style=\"logic_on\">绿色信号</style></b>\n位2：蛋数量越过其阈值时输出<b><style=\"logic_on\">绿色信号</style></b>（独立模式）\n位3：所追踪的数量上升时输出<b><style=\"logic_on\">绿色信号</style></b>脉冲\n位4：所追踪的数量下降时输出<b><style=\"logic_on\">绿色信号</style></b>脉冲"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MULTICHANNELCRITTERSENSOR.LOGIC_PORT_INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MULTICHANNELCRITTERSENSOR.LOGIC_PORT_INACTIVE"
msgid "Otherwise, sends a <b><style=\"logic_off\">Red Signal</style></b> on each bit"
msgstr "否则，每一位都输出<b><style=\"logic_off\">红色信号</style></b>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MULTICHANNELCRITTERSENSOR.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MULTICHANNELCRITTERSENSOR.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MULTICHANNELCRITTERSENSOR\">Multichannel Critter Sensor</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MULTICHANNELCRITTERSENSOR\">多通道小动物传感器</link>"

