#. STRINGS.UI.UISIDESCREENS.MULTICHANNEL_CRITTER_SENSOR_SIDE_SCREEN.ALL_EGGS_TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.UISIDESCREENS.MULTICHANNEL_CRITTER_SENSOR_SIDE_SCREEN.ALL_EGGS_TOOLTIP"
