msgstr "计算所有种类的蛋，包括之后才发现的种类"

#. STRINGS.UI.UISIDESCREENS.MULTICHANNEL_CRITTER_SENSOR_SIDE_SCREEN.COMBINED_ABOVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.UISIDESCREENS.MULTICHANNEL_CRITTER_SENSOR_SIDE_SCREEN.COMBINED_ABOVE"
msgid "Bit 1 sends a <b><style=\"logic_on\">Green Signal</style></b> if there are more than <b>{0}</b> tracked <style=\"KKeyword\">Critters</style> or <style=\"KKeyword\">Eggs</style> in the room"
msgstr "若房间内所追踪的<style=\"KKeyword\">小动物</style>或<style=\"KKeyword\">蛋</style>多于<b>{0}</b>，位1输出<b><style=\"logic_on\">绿色信号</style></b>"

#. STRINGS.UI.UISIDESCREENS.MULTICHANNEL_CRITTER_SENSOR_SIDE_SCREEN.COMBINED_BELOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.UISIDESCREENS.MULTICHANNEL_CRITTER_SENSOR_SIDE_SCREEN.COMBINED_BELOW"
msgid "Bit 1 sends a <b><style=\"logic_on\">Green Signal</style></b> if there are fewer than <b>{0}</b> tracked <style=\"KKeyword\">Critters</style> or <style=\"KKeyword\">Eggs</style> in the room"
msgstr "若房间内所追踪的<style=\"KKeyword\">小动物</style>或<style=\"KKeyword\">蛋</style>少于<b>{0}</b>，位1输出<b><style=\"logic_on\">绿色信号</style></b>"

#. STRINGS.UI.UISIDESCREENS.MULTICHANNEL_CRITTER_SENSOR_SIDE_SCREEN.COUNT_CRITTERS_TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.UISIDESCREENS.MULTICHANNEL_CRITTER_SENSOR_SIDE_SCREEN.COUNT_CRITTERS_TOOLTIP"
msgid "Include critters in the count. The list below chooses which species; only discovered species are shown."
msgstr "将小动物计入数量。在下方列表中选择要计算的物种；只显示已发现的物种。"

#. STRINGS.UI.UISIDESCREENS.MULTICHANNEL_CRITTER_SENSOR_SIDE_SCREEN.COUNT_EGGS_TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.UISIDESCREENS.MULTICHANNEL_CRITTER_SENSOR_SIDE_SCREEN.COUNT_EGGS_TOOLTIP"
msgid "Include eggs in the count. The list below chooses which egg types; only discovered eggs are shown."
msgstr "将蛋计入数量。在下方列表中选择要计算的蛋的种类；只显示已发现的蛋。"

